==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Gory]] spawns after 140 seconds<sup>4,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Medu-san]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Medu-san]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Having at least one Surge Immune or anti-Aku meatshield and attacker such as [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] is necessary deal with the Medu-san. Alternatively, the stage can be rushed by killing the Devil Wife at the beginning with an Extra Money unit like [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] or Talented [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and sending out rushers such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]].

